OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FSurvivors of forced adoption speak to
OL,8,FITV News Social Affairs Editor Sarah
OL,9,FCorker about the search for their lost
OL,10,Frelatives
OL,12,FFrom a young age, Angie Tomlin from
OL,13,FGrantham in Lincolnshire loved
OL,14,Fanimals, especially horses. They
OL,15,Fprovided solace during a difficult
OL,16,Fchildhood. She was adopted as a baby
OL,17,Fin 1962 and had a traumatic
OL,18,Frelationship with her adoptive mother.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"She used to delight in saying that I
OL,8,Fwas unwanted, and that I'd been
OL,9,Fadopted to look after them in later
OL,10,Flife," Ms Tomlin said.
OL,12,FShe recalled how "no one did any check-
OL,13,Fups" on the children of adoptive
OL,14,Fparents back then, and she was
OL,15,Fcontinually told to "be grateful".
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
