CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FYears later, Ms Tomlin discovered that
OL,8,Fher birth mother had been 16,
OL,9,Funmarried and sent away to a mother
OL,10,Fand baby home in Grimsby to give birth
OL,11,Fin secret. She was then forced to put
OL,12,Fher baby, Angie, up for adoption.
OL,14,FBetween the 1940s and 1980s, thousands
OL,15,Fof unmarried women were sent to state
OL,16,Fand religious institutions across
OL,17,FBritain where infants were taken from
OL,18,Ftheir mothers for adoption simply
OL,19,Fbecause they were born outside of
OL,20,Fwedlock.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"Because it was so awful here growing
OL,8,Fup, from a really early age I just had
OL,9,Fthis idea that they'd (my parents)
OL,10,Fwould come and save me," Ms Tomlin
OL,11,Fadded.
OL,13,FDecades later in the 1990s, Ms Tomlin
OL,14,Freunited with her mother and learnt
OL,15,Fhow she had never been able to have
OL,16,Fany more children.
OL,18,FHer mother said she was "made to
OL,19,Fwatch" as her daughter was given up to
OL,20,Fher adoptive parents and "told 'your
OL,21,Fbaby has gone. Get on with your life.'"
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@WpmqD@bpnrD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FThe pair didn't have long together
OL,8,Fbefore her mother died from cancer,
OL,9,Fand to this day Ms Tomlin is still
OL,10,Flooking for her father. She said her
OL,11,Fsearches have "hit a brick wall".
OL,13,FMs Tomlin said she has been imagining
OL,14,Fher whole life what it might be like
OL,15,Fto meet her birth parents, and wonders
OL,16,Fif she has any brothers or sisters.
OL,18,F"I met my birth mother but desperately
OL,19,Fwant to find my father; he could have
OL,20,Fchildren, I could have siblings," she
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"I just want to find out what
OL,8,Fhappened. You spend your whole life
OL,9,Fwondering. You're desperate to feel
OL,10,Flike you actually belong. I want some
OL,11,Facceptance," she added.
OL,13,FOver the course of our long-running
OL,14,Finvestigation into the forced adoption
OL,15,Fscandal, ITV News has been contacted
OL,16,Fby dozens of people still searching
OL,17,Ffor lost family.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
