OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FAlan Straughton, aged 67 from
OL,8,FMorecambe, Lancashire, is looking for
OL,9,Fhis missing sister Ann, who was born
OL,10,Fin 1961 at Hopedene - a former home
OL,11,Ffor unmarried mothers in Newcastle.
OL,13,FHe has found her birth certificate,
OL,14,Fwhich states she was adopted, but
OL,15,Fafter that the trail goes cold.
OL,17,F"There's a possibility she's had her
OL,18,Fname changed, but there's a
OL,19,Fpossibility she could be one of the
OL,20,Fbabies that died," Mr Straughton said.
OL,26,@yD@AOU|D@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"I have the birth certificate, but you
OL,8,Fjust don't know."
OL,10,FMr Straughton has been left frustrated
OL,11,Fat the complicated and costly process
OL,12,Fof tracing his baby sister.
OL,14,F"I want to try and find her; my search
OL,15,Fhas started at Hopedene mother and
OL,16,Fbaby home, and now it's ended there.
OL,17,FThere's just no trace," he added.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@QO]vD@AOUyD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
