OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FIn Teesside, it's a similar story for
OL,8,Fthe Pattison family. Jackie Pattison's
OL,9,Fmum Rose died never knowing what
OL,10,Fhappened to her baby son John.
OL,12,FHe was taken from her shortly after he
OL,13,Fwas born in Chesterfield in 1951
OL,14,Fbecause she was unmarried.
OL,16,F"She went one day to the nursery, and
OL,17,Fhe was just gone; she never got a
OL,18,Fchance to say goodbye. She would get
OL,19,Fvery angry about it, and say 'I never
OL,20,Fgave him up for adoption'," Ms
OL,21,FPattison told ITV News.
OL,26,@xD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"If he's still alive I'd like him to
OL,8,Fknow his mam never gave up on him,"
OL,9,Fshe said.
OL,11,FAlongside her nephew Kevin Pickard,
OL,12,Fthe family is trying to get to the
OL,13,Ftruth about what happened to him. They
OL,14,Fbelieve the infant may have been
OL,15,Fillegally sent abroad.
OL,17,FWith the help of a genealogist, they
OL,18,Fhave discovered shipping records which
OL,19,Fsuggest that baby John Ellis, seven
OL,20,Fmonths old, made the voyage from
OL,21,FLiverpool to New York in November 1951.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FHe was the youngest passenger on the
OL,8,Fship. All trace of him then vanishes.
OL,10,FMr Pickard recalls the lifelong impact
OL,11,Fthat the separation had on his
OL,12,Fgrandmother.
OL,14,FHe said: "She never stopped searching.
OL,15,FShe always said 'my baby John, my baby
OL,16,FJohn'. I think that's where a lot of
OL,17,Fher anger came from. We've lived all
OL,18,Fthese years without answers."
OL,26,@vD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"Does he know he had a mam that loved
OL,8,Fhim? He's got family here that love
OL,9,Fhim, we need to find him for my nana."
OL,11,FRose passed away in 2014 without any
OL,12,Fanswers.
OL,14,FIn July, after years of campaigning by
OL,15,Fsurvivors, the government formally
OL,16,Fapologised for its central role in
OL,17,Fforced adoption practices and also
OL,18,Fpledged extra support for families
OL,19,Ftrying to trace loved ones.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FBridget Phillipson, Minister for Women
OL,8,Fand Equalities, told ITV News that
OL,9,F"many organisations and others have
OL,10,Fdestroyed records or records were not
OL,11,Fpreserved".
OL,13,FShe said: "I do appreciate how
OL,14,Ftraumatic it is for people who have
OL,15,Fsearched desperately to find out
OL,16,Finformation about who they are and
OL,17,Fwhat happened, only to discover that
OL,18,Fit isn't there.
OL,26,@qD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"I am writing to local authorities, to
OL,8,Fregional adoption agencies and others
OL,9,Fto make sure they do what they need to
OL,10,Fin order to allow people to get that
OL,11,Finformation and get access to their
OL,12,Frecords."
OL,14,FThe government has announced a #4
OL,15,Fmillion funding package over three
OL,16,Fyears.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FSome of that investment will go to
OL,8,Fcharity PAC-UK and its Family Connect
OL,9,Fservice to expand specialist record
OL,10,Faccess, counselling, and family-
OL,11,Ftracing services.
OL,13,FSince the state apology, PAC-UK has
OL,14,Fsaid calls to its helpline have
OL,15,Fdoubled.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FEmma Crowther-Duncan, National
OL,8,FDevelopment Lead at PAC-UK, said: "It
OL,9,Ftakes a lot of pick up the phone and
OL,10,Fsay 'I'd like to access an
OL,11,Fintermediary service', and we know the
OL,12,Fchallenges with accessing records."
OL,14,F"We know that it's a postcode lottery
OL,15,F- where you are living impacts how
OL,16,Fquickly you will get your file
OL,17,Finformation. That is a real barrier
OL,18,Ffor too many people," she added.
OL,26,@pD@cOUtD@cO]vD@AOUzD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
