SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786724319
OL,3,C'I could have siblings': Forced
OL,4,Cadoption survivors search for lost
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FMany families now hope this renewed
OL,8,Ffocus on the forced adoption era may
OL,9,Fhelp them finally get to the truth
OL,10,Fabout what happened to their loved
OL,11,Fones.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/17
